    <item>
      <title>FreeBSD 11.0 Release</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/freebsd-11-0-release/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 11 Oct 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/freebsd-11-0-release/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Lançado hoje o release oficial do FreeBSD 11.0.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://rodrigolira.eti.br/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/freebsd.png&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;freebsd&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;300&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;108&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/freebsd-11-0-release/images/freebsd-300x108.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/freebsd-11-0-release/images/freebsd-300x108.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/freebsd-11-0-release/images/freebsd-300x108.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/freebsd-11-0-release/images/freebsd-300x108.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A grande novidade desta versão do FreeBSD, é que já está com o novo modelo de suporte, que tem 5 anos, dessa forma o FreeBSD 11.0 terá suporte até 30 de setembro de 2021.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
